  "rationale": "Reuse the existing discovery memo in both report generation and sample export. Compare complete first/repeat public-owner preparation on the same retained store, exact report bytes and all exported sample bytes. The protocol permits only the measured two-load memo allocation overhead and checks current available host capacity. Each process peak includes its own initialization and both lifetimes; it is not a generation-device metric. Memo reuse retains the existing immutable-artifact size/mtime assumption. The ablation loads and discards the memo before restoring full hashing. Acquisition order and OS-cache limitations preclude a statistical confidence claim.",
